== Installation ==

1. unzip file and upload file featured-blogs.php into your /wp-content/plugins/.
2. Go to your plugins page and activate plugin.
3. Go to Settings/options >> Featured Blog List tab to update blog Ids to display under your featured blog list on your site.
4. add <?php featuredBlogsList() ?> to the template that you want the featured blogs to appears in.
